everything the high-end resort has to offer while <strong>bonding and growing closer to Robin</strong>. <strong>Lounge by the pool, indulge in the amenities, and make new connections.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/320d8134a686659656d53fa0aac4c0c0.avif?t=1765178937\" alt=\"My Femboy Roommate pool scene. Robin is laying on a lounge chair with glowing sun reflecting off of his skin while he gently smiles. His eyes are blue, hair is black and messy, and he is wearing a black swimsuit.\" width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your trip, you must also talk with other guests and participate in activities in order to <strong>plan something unforgettable to close off the trip: a marriage proposal.</strong> Will your <strong>'femboy roommate'</strong> become your <strong>'femboy fianc\u00e9'</strong> this weekend, or will you <strong>blow your chances at spending the rest of your life with Robin?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367820/extras/9b4f3156acc3ed951eef3601346a7dea.avif?t=1765178937\" alt=\"My Femboy Roommate gameplay features - what to expect section\" width=511 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full, original English voice acting for all major story scenes and events\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles, mini-games, and unlockable gifts that unlock new scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated CGs for most spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"